{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":399672,"duration_api_ms":536342,"num_turns":9,"result":"Review submitted. Consolidated score: **2.5 — Borderline Findings**.\n\nKey findings from the roundtable:\n\n- **Soundness 3.5**: Statistical methodology is strong at 7–8B scale but 32B analyses (n=19–20) are underpowered. The 12/12 HB claim overcounts by including fragile 32B tests.\n- **Excitement 2.5**: C1 (layer selection bias) is real but warns against a metric no published study uses. C2 (HS advantage) collapses with stronger text encoders and is position-confounded at 32B. Practical deployment gap is severe.\n- **Reproducibility 4.0**: Excellent detail, code promised, bug disclosure exemplary.\n- **Overall 2.5**: The paper's exceptional honesty is its greatest strength and weakness — it systematically surfaces evidence undermining its own contributions, leaving narrow residual scope after all caveats.\n\nReport written to `artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T085530/worst/review_report.md`.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a2f5c34f-450a-4cb0-8d49-f46f5e9bb4d0","total_cost_usd":2.5644422500000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58662,"cache_read_input_tokens":210106,"output_tokens":9510,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58662,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":64790,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5713,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5713},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1171,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001246,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":55,"outputTokens"